WEBVTT

ad-001
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.548
Snow streaks a mountain ridge beyond bare trees.

ad-002
00:00:04.012 --> 00:00:05.628
A man in black looks out.

ad-003
00:00:08.405 --> 00:00:09.611
The kitchen bustles.

ad-004
00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:17.802
A seasoned turkey sits in a foil pan.

ad-005
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.994
The family works at the counters.

ad-006
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.324
He runs up to the gray house.

ad-007
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.010
He rinses the strawberries.

ad-008
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:31.676
A splash in the blue bowl.

ad-009
00:00:35.822 --> 00:00:37.290
He trims strawberries.

ad-010
00:00:39.426 --> 00:00:41.464
He covers a jar of berry trifle.

ad-011
00:00:48.425 --> 00:00:50.127
Brick shops line the street.

ad-012
00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:00.640
He steps in, smiling.

ad-013
00:01:07.675 --> 00:01:08.809
They wear antlers.

ad-014
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.866
Inside a cafe, two men move to a table by tall windows.

ad-015
00:01:22.447 --> 00:01:23.877
One checks his camera.

ad-016
00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.116
They browse bins of records.

ad-017
00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:43.328
The man in black lifts Michael Jackson's Thriller.

ad-018
00:01:53.428 --> 00:01:55.562
They measure in ice cream pints.

ad-019
00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:05.046
The trifle sits among gold cups marked with names.

ad-020
00:02:05.255 --> 00:02:06.601
Heads bow in prayer.

ad-021
00:02:10.265 --> 00:02:12.187
The family eats around the table.

ad-022
00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:20.198
A shadow falls across the siding.

ad-023
00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.682
He sits on the deck rail.

ad-024
00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:36.431
A laptop shows a video editing timeline.

ad-025
00:02:36.802 --> 00:02:38.606
The two sit side by side.

ad-026
00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:43.979
A sunlit stairwell.

ad-027
00:02:47.155 --> 00:02:48.603
The family smiles.

ad-028
00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:51.488
A hymn on TV.

ad-029
00:03:08.322 --> 00:03:11.766
Barefoot, he tucks folded pants into a black duffel.

ad-030
00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:26.314
The young man in black again looks out over the snowy ridge.

ad-031
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.312
A card reads, “Thanks for watching.”

ad-032
00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:35.368
He drops from the rail and rolls on the grass.

ad-033
00:03:37.126 --> 00:03:38.288
A man rushes him.

ad-034
00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.894
The man in red clings to his waist.

ad-035
00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:55.618
They wrestle out of view.
